Package: bscode
Title: A Lightweight VS Code-Inspired Activity Bar for bslib
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person(
    "Joshua", "Kunst",
    email = "56481+jbkunst@users.noreply.github.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
  )
Description: Provides an opinionated, screen-filling page layout for Shiny
    applications. It reuses bslib navigation components while presenting them
    as a compact VS Code-inspired activity bar on the left or right.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/jbkunst/bscode
